ts Acid Angel from Asia, Acid Eyes, EVOLution, Visionary Vision, Hatchi and Sun. She first garnered attention through her participation in the survival competition show My Teenage Girl.","title":"Kim Yoo-yeon (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Yoo-yeon_%28singer%29"}},"Q131553044":{"id":"Q131553044","name":"Jakob Norrgård","ko":"","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Schakob"],"birth":"1993-03-22","death":"","birthplace":"Maxmo","nationality":["Finland"],"height":null,"occupations":["comedian","performing artist","composer"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q28153804","name":"KAJ","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jakobnorrgard/","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/29IjlSvgYp8GlShXykUZ07","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/d2ea0412-837f-4c01-b5b8-f0ea4dce7538"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q131920148":{"id":"Q131920148","name":"JL","ko":"","birthName":"Jay Lawrence Gaspar","birthNameEn":"Jay Lawrence Gaspar","aliases":["Jay Lawrence Gaspar","JL Gaspar"],"birth":"2004-04-21","death":"","birthplace":"Muntinlupa","nationality":["Philippines"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","dancer"],"debut":"2023","agencies":[{"name":"Universal Records","id":"Q3544661","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q135181578","name":"AHOF","start":"","end":""}],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Jay Lawrence Gaspar is a Filipino singer, dancer, and performer. In 2025, he won first place on the South Korean survival show Universe League receiving over 3 million votes, and subsequently debuted as a member of the K-pop boy group AHOF. Prior to this, on March 31, 2023, he debuted as the youngest member of the P-pop boy group PLUUS.","title":"JL Gaspar","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JL_Gaspar"}},"Q132007188":{"id":"Q132007188","name":"Zena","ko":"제나","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"2008-11-27","death":"","birthplace":"","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupati