 (타잔), is a South Korean model, rapper, and dancer. He first competed as a professional dancer at the Seoul International Dance Competition in 2017 and later became the first Korean male dancer to win consecutive gold medals at the 49th and 50th Dong‑A International Contemporary Dance Competition in 2019 and 2020. He debuted as a model at the 2022 F/W Seoul Fashion Week and is currently active as a member of AllDay Project, a co-ed group under The Black Label.","title":"Tarzzan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarzzan"}},"Q14779348":{"id":"Q14779348","name":"Lim Kim","ko":"김예림","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Ye-rin","Kim Ye Rin","Kim Yerin","Kim Ye-lin","Kim Yelin","Kim Ye Lin"],"birth":"1994-01-21","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","recording artist"],"debut":"2011","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/limkim12121/","x":"https://x.com/limkim12121","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4kGuk6HkL6hwuQrgSWISBv","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/787d1bf3-9800-4654-a095-c341dcabda16"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/Kim_Ye-Lim_in_2013.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kim_Ye-Lim_in_2013.jpg","author":"달덩이","license":"CC BY 2.0 kr"},"bio":{"text":"Lim Kim, birth name Kim Ye-rim, is a South Korean singer and a member of the band Togeworl with Do Dae-yoon. She competed in the Superstar K3 singing competition as a member of Togeworl, placing third. In 2013, Kim debuted as a solo singer, and is known for the song \"All Right.\" She left Mystic Entertainment after her contract ended in 2016.","title":"Lim Kim","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lim_Kim"}},"Q16082580":{"id":"Q16082580","name":"박혜성","ko":"","birthName":"박정희","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1968-04-04","death":"","bi